{%- comment -%}
  EU legal guarantee notice (Directive 2011/83/EU Art. 22a, design and
  content set by Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2025/1960).
  From 27 September 2026 traders selling goods to consumers in the EU must
  show the harmonised notice on the legal guarantee of conformity
  prominently, before the consumer is bound by the contract, and in colour
  when the sale happens online.

  The notice is an official, fixed design published by the European
  Commission in every EU language. It must be used in full and unmodified,
  so the theme never recreates the artwork: the merchant uploads the
  official RGB file in Theme settings > EU legal guarantee, and Valor shows
  that image whole (no cropping, no overlays) in a popover opened from the
  footer and from the product page "EU legal guarantee" block — the
  "Your legal guarantee rights" + first click pattern described in the
  Commission's practical guidelines (section 2.3, digital display).

  Alongside the artwork the popover always offers, per the guidelines and
  for accessibility:
    - a clickable link to the QR code's destination, the Your Europe page
      on legal guarantees in the shopper's language (derived from the
      storefront language, overridable in theme settings);
    - a text version of the notice (the official English wording, stored
      in the locale file so merchants can translate it under
      "Edit default theme content" to match the language of their notice).

  Modes:
    mode: 'dialog'   the popover holding the notice. Rendered once per page
                     by layout/theme.liquid.
    mode: 'trigger'  a button that opens the popover. Accepts:
                       class  {String} extra classes for the button
                       label  {String} button text (defaults to the
                              theme setting)

  Renders nothing when no notice image has been uploaded.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign notice_image = settings.legal_guarantee_notice
  assign notice_label = label | default: settings.legal_guarantee_label
  if notice_label == blank
    assign notice_label = 'general.legal_guarantee.default_label' | t
  endif
  assign notice_alt = notice_image.alt | default: notice_label

  comment
    Destination of the notice's QR code: the Your Europe page on legal
    guarantees, in one of the 24 official EU languages. The short links in
    the Commission's guidelines (europa.eu/youreurope/guarantees,
    …/virhevastuu, …) redirect to this canonical per-language URL.
  endcomment
  assign info_url = settings.legal_guarantee_info_url | strip
  if info_url == blank
    assign eu_languages = 'bg,cs,da,de,el,en,es,et,fi,fr,ga,hr,hu,it,lt,lv,mt,nl,pl,pt,ro,sk,sl,sv' | split: ','
    assign info_language = request.locale.iso_code | slice: 0, 2 | downcase
    unless eu_languages contains info_language
      assign info_language = 'en'
    endunless
    assign info_url = 'https://europa.eu/youreurope/citizens/consumers/shopping/guarantees/index_' | append: info_language | append: '.htm'
  endif
-%}

{%- if notice_image != blank -%}
  {%- if mode == 'dialog' -%}
    <div
      id="ValorLegalGuaranteeNotice"
      class="valor-legal-popover"
      popover
      role="dialog"
      aria-labelledby="ValorLegalGuaranteeNoticeTitle"
    >
      <div class="valor-legal-popover__header">
        <h2 id="ValorLegalGuaranteeNoticeTitle" class="valor-legal-popover__title">
          {{- notice_label | escape -}}
        </h2>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="valor-legal-popover__close"
          popovertarget="ValorLegalGuaranteeNotice"
          popovertargetaction="hide"
          aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.close' | t }}"
          autofocus
        >
          {{- 'icon-close.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="valor-legal-popover__body">
        {%- comment -%}
          The artwork keeps a legible minimum width and scrolls sideways on
          narrow screens / high zoom, so the scroll region is focusable and
          named for keyboard and screen-reader users.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <div
          class="valor-legal-popover__artwork valor-legal-popover__artwork--notice"
          role="region"
          aria-label="{{ notice_label | escape }}"
          tabindex="0"
        >
          {{-
            notice_image
            | image_url: width: 1600
            | image_tag:
              class: 'valor-legal-popover__image',
              loading: 'lazy',
              widths: '600, 800, 1000, 1200, 1600',
              sizes: '(min-width: 800px) 760px, 36rem',
              alt: notice_alt
          -}}
        </div>

        <ul class="valor-legal-popover__links" role="list">
          <li>
            <a href="{{ info_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              {{- 'general.legal_guarantee.info_link' | t -}}
              <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'accessibility.link_messages.new_window' | t }}</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="{{ notice_image | image_url: width: 3000 }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              {{- 'general.legal_guarantee.open_full_size' | t -}}
              <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'accessibility.link_messages.new_window' | t }}</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <details class="valor-legal-popover__text-version">
          <summary>{{ 'general.legal_guarantee.text_version' | t }}</summary>
          <div id="ValorLegalGuaranteeNoticeText" class="valor-legal-popover__text rte">
            <h3>{{ 'general.legal_guarantee.notice.title' | t }}</h3>
            <p><strong>{{ 'general.legal_guarantee.notice.intro' | t }}</strong></p>
            <p>{{ 'general.legal_guarantee.notice.claim' | t }}</p>
            <ul>
              <li>{{ 'general.legal_guarantee.notice.claim_description' | t }}</li>
              <li>{{ 'general.legal_guarantee.notice.claim_function' | t }}</li>
            </ul>
            <p>{{ 'general.legal_guarantee.notice.liability' | t }}</p>
            <ul>
              <li>{{ 'general.legal_guarantee.notice.remedy_repair' | t }}</li>
              <li>{{ 'general.legal_guarantee.notice.remedy_price' | t }}</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong>{{ 'general.legal_guarantee.notice.steps_title' | t }}</strong></p>
            <ol>
              <li>{{ 'general.legal_guarantee.notice.step_contact' | t }}</li>
              <li>{{ 'general.legal_guarantee.notice.step_proof' | t }}</li>
            </ol>
            <p>{{ 'general.legal_guarantee.notice.countries' | t }}</p>
            <p>
              {{ 'general.legal_guarantee.notice.more_information' | t }}
              <a href="{{ info_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                {{- info_url | remove: 'https://' -}}
                <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'accessibility.link_messages.new_window' | t }}</span>
              </a>
            </p>
            <p>{{ 'general.legal_guarantee.notice.commercial' | t }}</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- else -%}
    <button
      type="button"
      class="valor-legal-guarantee-trigger{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}"
      popovertarget="ValorLegalGuaranteeNotice"
      aria-haspopup="dialog"
    >
      {{- notice_label | escape -}}
    </button>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
